    "type": "game",
    "name": "Curiosmos",
    "steam_appid": 2585710,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/be5377b2317ed67da881beebc85d7797.poster.avif?t=1752681353\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/be5377b2317ed67da881beebc85d7797.webm?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/be5377b2317ed67da881beebc85d7797.mp4?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outer space never looked so cute! Curiosmos is a whimsical  space sim where you design a solar system from the ground up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collide stardust and asteroids to make a new planet. Once the planet is large enough you can zoom in and play around on the surface. Experiment with shaping the land and weather. Your planet will be curiously watching as you discover how to create clouds, rain, thunder, mountains, volcanoes and even add a sprinkle of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/531519b324d095af1333873e6fbb66a3.poster.avif?t=1752681353\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/531519b324d095af1333873e6fbb66a3.webm?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/531519b324d095af1333873e6fbb66a3.mp4?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up your solar system with many more planets and moons and go out to explore the asteroid belt. Be in charge of creating a friendly neighbourhood for your sun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/4aa3f34f707290d76d305949ab8c3b7d.poster.avif?t=1752681353\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/4aa3f34f707290d76d305949ab8c3b7d.webm?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/4aa3f34f707290d76d305949ab8c3b7d.mp4?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, only a few light-years away, an insatiable black hole is planning to devour your sun \u2013 but with the help of a little lost satellite, you might just save the solar system. Discover the secrets of the universe in an adorable ode to the beauty of outer space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THINGS YOU CAN DO IN SPACE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Create your own solar system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 Add planets, moons &amp; hunt for asteroids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Make friends with a cute robot \u270c\ufe0e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26c8\ufe0f Play with weather! Make clouds, rain, thunder, snow.. Tornadoes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Orchestrate life, plants, creatures and evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1d Make your planets happy or turn them into an angry volcanic disaster \u2013 they're emotional, just like you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Complete a series of quests because checking things off a list feels great!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Save the galaxy from an insatiable black hole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4d Play a charming ode to the beauty of outer space \u2736</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/be5377b2317ed67da881beebc85d7797.poster.avif?t=1752681353\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/be5377b2317ed67da881beebc85d7797.webm?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/be5377b2317ed67da881beebc85d7797.mp4?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outer space never looked so cute! Curiosmos is a whimsical  space sim where you design a solar system from the ground up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collide stardust and asteroids to make a new planet. Once the planet is large enough you can zoom in and play around on the surface. Experiment with shaping the land and weather. Your planet will be curiously watching as you discover how to create clouds, rain, thunder, mountains, volcanoes and even add a sprinkle of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/531519b324d095af1333873e6fbb66a3.poster.avif?t=1752681353\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/531519b324d095af1333873e6fbb66a3.webm?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/531519b324d095af1333873e6fbb66a3.mp4?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill up your solar system with many more planets and moons and go out to explore the asteroid belt. Be in charge of creating a friendly neighbourhood for your sun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/4aa3f34f707290d76d305949ab8c3b7d.poster.avif?t=1752681353\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/4aa3f34f707290d76d305949ab8c3b7d.webm?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2585710/extras/4aa3f34f707290d76d305949ab8c3b7d.mp4?t=1752681353\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, only a few light-years away, an insatiable black hole is planning to devour your sun \u2013 but with the help of a little lost satellite, you might just save the solar system. Discover the secrets of the universe in an adorable ode to the beauty of outer space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THINGS YOU CAN DO IN SPACE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab Create your own solar system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 Add planets, moons &amp; hunt for asteroids!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Make friends with a cute robot \u270c\ufe0e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26c8\ufe0f Play with weather! Make clouds, rain, thunder, snow.. Tornadoes?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Orchestrate life, plants, creatures and evolution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1d Make your planets happy or turn them into an angry volcanic disaster \u2013 they're emotional, just like you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Complete a series of quests because checking things off a list feels great!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Save the galaxy from an insatiable black hole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4d Play a charming ode to the beauty of outer space \u2736</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Curiosmos is a cozy space sim where you build your own solar system by hand, crafting planets, moons, gravity, atmosphere, and even life! Embark on a quest to discover the secrets of the universe!",
